# README media: UNDERDELVE
# The cartridge boots straight into Mo's camp (no title screen, as in Barbuta).
shotscale 2
game underdelve
wait 40
shot underdelve_camp
cheat room 4 2 120 120
cheat no_gloom
wait 20
gifstart underdelve 2 2
wait 10
hold RIGHT 45
press B
wait 12
press B
wait 12
press B
wait 12
press B
wait 20
hold RIGHT 30
hold RIGHT+A 3
hold RIGHT 40
wait 30
gifstop
cheat room 4 2 150 120
cheat no_gloom
wait 30
shot underdelve_grotto
cheat room 2 0 60 130
cheat lanterns 6
wait 150
shot underdelve_boss
